{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your friends are hired as Liquidators\u2014a crew meant to transform a wasteland back into its pristine state. Before you are allowed to enter the radioactive wilderness, you\u2019ll need to complete the onboarding process and prove your grit. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What's in it:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Participate in an onboarding process that includes training for new Liquidators and show your skills in an exclusion area control point #001.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- See what it's like being a WEA Liquidator with most of the major mechanics from the full game available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Take a glance at the radioactive wilderness on top of the wall \u2014 your future work site.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Stay alert: something dangerous happened at WEA-001 Control Point, and you might be asked to help\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3434810?t=1744995727","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3434810?t=1744995727","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434810/3697dde64e08c37f55d2f5780485fd8a183b2e1c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744995727","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434810/3697dde64e08c37f55d2f5780485fd8a183b2e1c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744995727","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains frequent scenes of violence and gore. Gameplay primarily involves combat using weapons and shooting. Players will encounter depictions of violence, including shooting human characters and non-human creatures."},"detail